   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about the weather",
     "texto": [
      "**Musim hujan** is the rainy season and **musim kemarau**, the dry one. Adjectives do not change for gender or number: **cuaca cerah**, **hari cerah**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the reason",
     "texto": [
      "**Mengapa?** means \"why?\". To answer, **karena** means \"because\". As in English, the reason can go at the start or at the end of the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
